enalty + triplet variety.\n\nRefinement of `tally_span_switch_ideal_periodic_unit`: people keep a running\nheads-minus-tails tally and judge a sequence random by how close the tally's\nspan is to their own expected span (personal left/right lean), judge switching\nby closeness to a shared ideal switching rate (person-specific weight), and see\na sequence repeating a short unit as designed. The one change: they also reward\nthe variety of short local patterns -- a shared reward on the share of distinct\noverlapping three-flip chunks (from `tally_span_switch_ideal_triplet_variety`),\ngrading the all-or-none periodicity judgement.\n\"\"\"'''+src[doc_end:]\nsrc=src.replace('''    a = sequence_a.strip().upper()''','''    def triplet_variety(seq):\n        n_windows = len(seq) - 2\n        if n_windows < 1:\n            return 0.0\n        distinct = len({seq[i:i + 3] for i in range(n_windows)})\n        return distinct / min(8, n_windows)\n\n    a = sequence_a.strip().upper()''')\nsrc=src.replace('''        \"log_len\":''','''        \"trip_diff\": triplet_variety(a) - triplet_variety(b),\n        \"log_len\":''')\nsrc=src.replace('''    log_len = pm.Data(''','''    trip_diff = pm.Data(\"trip_diff\", np.zeros(1, dtype=\"float64\"))\n    log_len = pm.Data(''')\nsrc=src.replace('''    # The change: shared penalty on a visibly repeating unit.\n    rho = pm.Normal(\"rho\", mu=0.0, sigma=1.0)''','''    # Shared penalty on a visibly repeating unit (as in the incumbent).\n    rho = pm.Normal(\"rho\", mu=0.0, sigma=1.0)\n\n    # The change: shared reward on the share of distinct three-flip chunks.\n    gamma = pm.Normal(\"gamma\", mu=0.0, sigma=2.0)''')\nsrc=src.replace('''        + rho * (per_b - per_a)\n''','''        + rho * (per_b - per_a)\n        + gamma * trip_diff\n''')\nopen(\"/scratch/users/kushinm/auto-psych/outer_loop_live/run2/data/subjective_randomness/experiment3/model_loop/iter_0/candidate_4/candidate.py\",\"w\").write(src)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"trip\\|gamma\" $D/candi